          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports a tight foreskin, harder to pull back especially when erect. Duration is uncertain: 'few months or maybe since last year'. On examination, foreskin would not fully retract even when flaccid; tight fibrotic ring at the preputial opening, with glans only partly visible."
